@startuml fs_content_01_seq_authoring
skinparam backgroundColor #0F0E17
skinparam defaultFontColor #E5E7EB
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #A5B4FC
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #6366F1
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #1A1830
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #6366F1
skinparam sequenceDividerBackgroundColor #1A1830
skinparam sequenceDividerFontColor #E5E7EB
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #1A1830
skinparam noteBorderColor #6366F1
skinparam noteFontColor #E5E7EB
skinparam titleFontColor #E5E7EB
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #E5E7EB
title FS-CONTENT-01 — Write and publish an article
autonumber "[00]"

actor "Owner" as O #1E1B4B
participant "Backoffice SPA\n(browser)" as UI #172554
participant "Admin API\n(Nitro)" as API #172554
participant "Shared validator" as V #172554
database "D1 articles" as DB #052E16
participant "Edge cache" as C #052E16

== Phase 1 — Writing, entirely in the browser ==
O -> UI : types Markdown
UI -> V : validateArticle (same code as the server)
V --> UI : errors, warnings, parsed article
UI --> O : live preview + "Valid" or "N to check"

== Phase 2 — Save ==
O -> UI : Save (button or Ctrl/Cmd+S)
UI -> API : PUT /api/admin/articles/ID (markdown, published)
API -> API : admin-guard: session cookie + same-origin
group Not signed in [401]
  API --> UI : 401
  UI --> O : redirected to sign-in
end
API -> V : validateArticle(id, markdown)
group Invalid [422]
  API --> UI : 422 with the reason
  UI --> O : error shown, nothing saved
end
API -> API : normalize line endings, compute bytes and sha256
API -> DB : UPDATE title, body, minutes, bytes, sha256, published, updated_at
DB --> API : changes = 1
API -> C : purge library.json and article .md
API --> UI : 200 with warnings
UI --> O : "Saved"

== Phase 3 — Reach ==
note over C, DB
  Website: next request reads D1 (within seconds).
  Phones: next daily sync sees the new sha256.
end note
@enduml
